repository-code: "Local packaged research release"
abstract: "A dynamic, intervention-aware research platform with prospectively locked experimental cycles, LIMS/ELN contracts, model-freeze and preregistration manifests, QC-aware posterior updating, adaptive stopping, cost accounting, calibration tracking, and retained dynamic, multimodal, intervention, spatial, cancer, and neurobiology workflows."
keywords:
  - causal AI
  - single-cell
  - spatial omics
  - drug response
  - biomarkers
  - neurobiology
  - dynamic trajectory forecasting
  - neural controlled differential equations
  - perturbation generalization
  - prospective experimentation
  - LIMS and ELN
  - preregistration
  - adaptive experimental design
